        "Title": "The Frozen Truth",
        "Location": "LOCATION_HOKKAIDO_FLU",
        "PublicId": "118470179308",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_flu.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 8e78f7a2-5def-4d32-aae6-001cb76a4d7f).Image",
        "Description": "Agent 47, we have a situation at a medical facility in Hokkaido.\r\rSeveral patients have died from the Invictus virus. To keep the outbreak hidden, a group of armed guards has taken the morgue staff hostage and is forcing the doctors to make the infected bodies disappear.\r\rYour targets are the guards running the operation.\r\rEliminate them using melee weapons only. Once the job is done, leave the facility by snowmobile.\r\rKeep it quiet, 47. The fewer people who know what happened here, the better.",
